ssues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":39,"created_at":"2025-02-10T15:51:37Z","updated_at":"2025-09-21T16:38:04Z","closed_at":"2025-03-17T21:10:43Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102662","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102662","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102662.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102662.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-17T21:10:43Z"},"body":"Right now, TileMapLayer physics is implemented using one collision body for each cell, which is likely lowering runtime performance (to be verified, but I doubt having thousands of colliders on a map has no impact). This PR reworks the TileMapLayer physics so that cells shapes get merged into bigger collision shapes, whenever possible. A`physics_quadrant_size` param allow changing the size of each collision chunk.\r\n\r\nThis video illustrate the processing done:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ce32292c-f8f5-47d5-8fe2-506f3f097932\r\n\r\nNote this PR breaks compatibility for `get_coords_for_body_rid`, as with the PR, a single body can cover multiple cells.\r\n\r\n*Bugsquad edit:* Fixes #84163 Fixes #89458","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/r